\par\par \uc2 CE Noticias Financieras English\par \b \uc2 The blue dollar balances near its record high: the day's key figures\b0\par\par\uc2 433 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Januar 2023\par \uc2 CE NoticiasFinancieras\par \uc2 NFINCE\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 Content Engine LLC \par \par \uc2 With its sights set on its ceiling, the blue dollar starts the week today The blue dollar is trading today at $354 for sale and $350 for purchase in the caves of the City of Buenos Aires, after rising one peso last Friday and recovering what it had lost on Thursday, when it recorded the first drop of the year. Thus, the parallel banknote is only $3 away from its historical high, which it reached on December 28. With these figures, the gap is 89.7% with the retail dollar and 97.5% with the wholesale dollar.\par \par \uc2 Dollar today: news of the day Historical Blue Dollar Infogram Lula da Silva decreed federal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Brasilia The president of \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \uc2 Luiz In\u225\'00\'E1cio Lula da Silva\uc2 , decreed this Sunday the federal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Brasilia\par \par \uc2 after the attacks that hundreds of supporters of his predecessor, \uc2 Jair Bolsonaro\uc2 , perpetrated this afternoon against the headquarters of the three public powers, in the capital, and warned that the "terrorists" who carried them out "will pay with the full force of the law"\par \par \uc2 . Chinese Swap: as from today it will be available As from this Monday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will have USD 5,000 million of free availability of the Swap with China. These resources may be used to offset \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market transactions. According to Government sources consulted by BAE Negocios, these foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  will help the GDP to grow again in 2023, in a context where there will continue to be devaluation pressures linked to the management of reserves.\par \par \uc2 Indec will publish the December CPI, which is projected to be around 5% On Thursday, Indec will publish the December inflation. The expectation is that the month will have closed with an increase of around 5%. For the Ministry of Economy it was below that number, for consulting firms and banks in the city it could have been as high as 5.5%. Food slowed down its dynamics but it was still the main driver, together with textiles and restaurants. The CPI for 2022 closed between 93% and 95.5%.\par \par \uc2 Is winter over? Cryptocurrencies rebound Cryptocurrencies soar for the first time since the beginning of 2021 up 21% this Monday, January 9. Bitcoin rises 1.91% in the last 24 hs and allows the crypto leader to surpass USD 17,000 for the first time since December 20. Ethereum, meanwhile , rebounds nearly 4% and surpasses USD 1300. In the cryptocurrency market, the rises are led by Solana and Cardano up to 21%.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020230109ej1900c5r\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
