\par\par \b \uc2 Lula builds out econ team with Mercadante at BNDES, ex-banker aide to Haddad\b0\par\par\uc2 424 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Dezember 2022\par 02:14\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 BRASILIA (Reuters) - More of Brazilian President-elect \uc2 Luiz Inacio Lula da Silva\uc2 's economic policy team took shape on Tuesday, with Workers Party (PT) veteran Aloizio Mercadante running development bank BNDES and a former banker taking a key role at the Economy Ministry.\par \par \uc2 Brazilian financial markets reacted as Lula named Mercadante as investors gauged the possible return of the PT's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in long-term credit markets.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  gave back gains and the Bovespa stock index deepened losses, dropping 1.71% after reports of the new role for Mercadante, who also served as chief of staff to Lula's PT successor following his 2003-2010 presidency, former President \uc2 Dilma Rousseff\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Incoming Finance Minister Fernando Haddad said separately on Tuesday that former investment bank \uc2 Banco Fator\uc2  Chief Executive Gabriel Galipolo would be appointed as his executive secretary, underscoring an emphasis on public-private partnerships in the next administration.\par \par \uc2 The former banker, whose new role was first reported by Reuters on Tuesday, has advised several public-private partnerships as managing partner at the Galipolo Consultancy since leaving \uc2 Banco Fator\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Seen as an economist with connections across the ideological spectrum, Galipolo helped set up meetings between Haddad and business leaders during this year's election, when the incoming finance minister ran a failed Sao Paulo gubernatorial campaign.\par \par \uc2 Galipolo has co-authored books and articles with Luiz Gonzaga Belluzzo, a longtime Lula adviser and economics professor at Unicamp, considered a center of heterodox economic thought.\par \par \uc2 He also served as an economic adviser in the Sao Paulo state government under center-right Governor Jos\u233\'00\'E9 Serra.\par \par \uc2 By contrast, Mercadante has long been a prominent member of Lula's Workers Party, as lawmaker in both chambers of Congress and in several roles in Rousseff's Cabinet.\par \par \uc2 A member of Lula's transition team, Mercadante took part in a recent news conference stressing the need to reform how BNDES charges interest rates to lenders.\par \par \uc2 Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which is now formally independent from the president's Cabinet, has openly opposed a return to state-subsidized long-term credit, which would likely reduce the impact of monetary policy.\par \par \uc2 In his first press conference late afternoon, Haddad also appointed economist Bernard Appy as the country's special secretary for tax reform, which he highlighted will be a priority in the new government.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Marcela Ayres and Lisandra Paraguassu; Editing by Steven Grattan, Paul Simao, Aurora Ellis and Marguerita Choy) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2022-12-14T01:14:03.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020221214eice004ed\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
