\par\par \b \uc2 EMERGING MARKETS-Softer dollar, strong commodities lift \uc2 Latam \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 ; S.African rand weighs on EM\b0\par\par\uc2 627 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Dezember 2022\par 16:22\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par \par         * \par       Chile's economic activity index down 1.2% in October\par     \par \par         * \par       Brazil's economy grows less than expected in Q3 \par     \par \par         * \par       \f28 \uc2 \f2 Latam\f28 \uc2 \f2  stocks up 1%, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  add 1.4% \par     \par \par         * \par       Dollar dips as Powell says Fed to go slow\par     \par \par         * \par       S.African rand falls on panel findings against president\par     \par \par   \par     By Bansari Mayur Kamdar\par        Dec 1 (Reuters) - Latin American \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  extended\par gains on Thursday, helped by strong commodity prices and\par weakness in the dollar, while a dip in the South African rand\par amid rising political uncertainty weighed on broader emerging\par markets.\par     \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in Latin America rose 1.4%,\par outpacing the broader emerging market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  index\par . \par     The U.S. dollar index tumbled 1% after comments by\par Federal Reserve Chair \f28 \uc2 \f2 Jerome Powell\f28 \uc2 \f2  that U.S. rate hikes could\par be scaled back "as soon as December".\par     South Africa's rand dropped 3% against the dollar,\par weighing on the EM index as investors digested the news that\par President \f28 \uc2 \f2 Cyril Ramaphosa\f28 \uc2 \f2  may be impeached following a panel of\par experts' findings against him. \par     "It is yet more political instability in what is already a\par volatile country and it potentially leaves the markets facing\par months of political infighting if Ramaphosa is ultimately\par removed," said Stuart Cole, head macro economist at Equiti\par Capital.  \par     "All in all, it's not very supportive for the ZAR."\par     In Latin America, the Brazilian real extended\par gains for a fourth straight session, rising 0.2%.\par     Brazil's economic growth slowed more than expected in the\par third quarter as higher interest rates affected household\par spending, underscoring challenges facing President-elect \f28 \uc2 \f2 Luiz\par Inacio Lula da Silva\f28 \uc2 \f2  next year.\par     The real has underperformed its regional peers in November,\par ending last month nearly flat compared to the 1% rise in the\par broader \f28 \uc2 \f2 Latam\f28 \uc2 \f2  index. \par     \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Brazil\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par market on Thursday, selling $2 billion in the spot market with a\par repurchase agreement, it said in a statement on its website.\par     Lula has also pushed back his first Cabinet announcements to\par next week, two people familiar with the matter said on\par Wednesday, dragging out key appointments that have kept\par financial markets on edge.\par     \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of oil producers Mexico and Colombia\par  gained 0.7% and 0.9%, respectively, as the potential for\par OPEC+ to cut supply further and easing COVID curbs in top\par importer China buoyed crude prices.\par     Top copper producer Chile's peso added 0.5% against\par the softer greenback, supported by strong copper prices as\par investors bet that slower U.S. interest rate hikes and an easing\par of China's COVID controls would improve its demand outlook.\par     Gains were capped by growing fears of recession after data\par showed a drop in the Andean nation's IMACEC economic activity\par index, a close proxy of GDP, in October from the same month last\par year.\par     Peru's Sol slid 0.5% against the dollar after data\par showed consumer prices rose more than expected in November. \par     The MSCI index for Latin American stocks\par gained 1%, with Colombia's COLCAP leading gains.\par     Key Latin American stock indexes and \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  at 1453 GMT:\par         Stock indexes                  Latest       Daily %\par                                                      change\par  MSCI Emerging Markets                     979.45        0.74\par  MSCI LatAm                               2255.46           1\par  Brazil Bovespa                         111491.78       -0.88\par  Mexico IPC                              51588.23       -0.19\par  Chile IPSA                               5272.41       -0.19\par  Argentina MerVal                       169589.17       0.631\par  Colombia COLCAP                          1248.13        0.44\par                                                              \par            \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2                   Latest       Daily %\par                                                      change\par  Brazil real                               5.1701        0.56\par  Mexico peso                              19.1479        0.54\par  Chile peso                                 887.9        0.23\par  Colombia peso                            4768.69        1.22\par  Peru sol                                    3.83        0.65\par  Argentina peso (interbank)              167.6500       -0.20\par                                                    \par  Argentina peso (parallel)                    310        1.29\par                                                    \par     \par  (Reporting by Bansari Mayur Kamdar in Bengaluru; Editing by\par Kirsten Donovan)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Released: 2022-12-1T16:22:29.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020221201eic1039tq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw109\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1635\pichgoal600
