 our business; \u9679\'25\'CF the availability of qualified personnel and the ability to retain such personnel;\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Table of Contents\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \u9679\'25\'CF changes in the financial condition of the students enrolling in our schools in general and in the competitive conditions in the education industry, or changes in the financial condition of our schools; \u9679\'25\'CF our capitalization and level of indebtedness; \u9679\'25\'CF changes in government regulations applicable to the education industry in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Brazil\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ; \u9679\'25\'CF government \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in education industry programs, that affect the economic or tax regime, the collection of tuition fees or the regulatory framework applicable to educational institutions; \u9679\'25\'CF a decline in the number of students enrolled in our programs or the amount of tuition we can charge; \u9679\'25\'CF our ability to compete and conduct our business in the future; \u9679\'25\'CF the success of operating initiatives, including advertising and promotional efforts and new product, service and concept development by us and our competitors; \u9679\'25\'CF changes in consumer demands and preferences and technological advances, and our ability to innovate to respond to such changes; \u9679\'25\'CF changes in labor, distribution and other operating costs; \u9679\'25\'CF our compliance with, and changes to, government laws, regulations and tax matters that currently apply to us; \u9679\'25\'CF our ability to complete the business combination with CESUMAR - Centro de Ensino Superior de Maring\u225\'00\'E1 Ltda., or "UniCesumar," in a timely manner or at all; \u9679\'25\'CF our ability to realize the anticipated benefits of the business combination with UniCesumar, or the "UniCesumar Business Combination"; \u9679\'25\'CF other factors that may affect our financial condition, liquidity an