\par\par \b \uc2 EMERGING MARKETS-Brazil's real outperforms Latam peers\b0\par\par\uc2 554 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 September 2021\par 16:54\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2021 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     * Brazil's real up 0.1% against stronger dollar\par     * Colombian stocks jump 1.4% as \f28 \uc2 \f2 Ecopetrol\f28 \uc2 \f2  rallies\par \par     By Susan Mathew\par     Sept 27 (Reuters) - \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  saw \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Brazil\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's\par real outperform most Latin American \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on Monday, while\par a near 4% jump for oil major \f28 \uc2 \f2 Ecopetrol\f28 \uc2 \f2  put the Colombian equity\par benchmark on course for its best session in nearly six weeks. \par     Most regional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  weakened as the dollar perked up on\par rising Treasury yields and after upbeat U.S. durable goods data.\par \par     Brazil's real ticked 0.1% higher. The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par late on Friday said it would hold additional twice weekly\par auctions of traditional \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  swaps, starting Sept. 27, to\par address demand from banks dismantling their "over-hedge"\par position to protect against exchange rate fluctuations.\par \par     But, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is down almost 3% so far this year, as\par political uncertainty outweighed headwinds from an aggressively\par hawkish \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . Worries about policy moves by President\par \f28 \uc2 \f2 Jair Bolsonaro\f28 \uc2 \f2  leading up to elections next year have increased\par as his popularity plummets. \par     "When we look at the broader institutions in Brazil, the\par room for Bolsonaro to make significant trouble is limited but it\par will be very noisy over the next few months. That will probably\par turn some investors away, but create valuation opportunities,"\par said \f28 \uc2 \f2 Derrick Irwin\f28 \uc2 \f2 , portfolio manager at Wells Fargo's Berkeley\par Street Emerging Markets Equity team.\par     Stocks in Sao Paulo rose 0.5% with oil stocks in the\par lead as crude prices rose amid supply concerns. Oil giant\par \f28 \uc2 \f2 Petrobras\f28 \uc2 \f2  rallied around 2%. The Bovespa\par index is down about 4.6% this year compared with a 2% slide in\par the broader EM shares index\par     "Threading the needle in Brazil is going to be challenging\par but there are some really good companies," Irwin said, adding\par that in Latam, they are overweight on Mexican equities. \par     Mexico's \f28 \uc2 \f2 IPC\f28 \uc2 \f2  index, up 0.8% on Monday, has gained\par about 17% in 2021. \par     Cement maker \f28 \uc2 \f2 Cemex\f28 \uc2 \f2  rose 2.6% after rating\par agency S&P revised its outlook to positive from negative.\par \par     Colombia's COLCAP index jumped 1.4% to a two-week\par high as \f28 \uc2 \f2 Ecopetrol\f28 \uc2 \f2  looked to log its biggest gain in\par five weeks.\par     \f28 \uc2 \f2 Ecopetrol\f28 \uc2 \f2 's crude oil exports to Asia is seen rising, the\par company's chief executive said on Monday. Some 63% of the oil\par firm's crude exports have been shipped to Asia in 2021, compared\par with 52% last year.\par     The moves in Latam equities were in line with most other EM\par shares on Monday which climbed as hopes rose that Beijing would\par step in to limit the fallout from debt-laden Chinese developer\par Evergrande.\par     \par     Key Latin American stock indexes and \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  at 1433 GMT:\par    Stock indexes           Latest    Daily %\par                                      change\par  MSCI Emerging Markets      1265.63     0.04\par                                      \par  MSCI LatAm                 2306.94     0.45\par                                      \par  Brazil Bovespa           113637.57     0.31\par                                      \par  Mexico IPC                51487.38     0.75\par                                      \par  Chile IPSA                 4385.50     0.18\par                                      \par  Argentina MerVal          75000.86    1.106\par                                      \par  Colombia COLCAP            1327.65      1.4\par                                      \par                                             \par       \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2            Latest    Daily %\par                                      change\par  Brazil real                 5.3409     0.05\par                                      \par  Mexico peso                20.1080    -0.34\par                                      \par  Chile peso                   795.7    -0.35\par                                      \par  Colombia peso              3839.83    -0.20\par                                      \par  Peru sol                    4.1031    -0.13\par                                      \par  Argentina peso             98.6700    -0.08\par  (interbank)                         \par                                      \par  \par  (Reporting by Susan Mathew in Bengaluru;\par Editing by Alistair Bell)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Released: 2021-9-27T15:54:25.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020210927eh9r02ue5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
