\par\par \b \uc2 EMERGING MARKETS-U.S. inflation relief proves short-lived for  \highlight22\uc2 currencies \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 536 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 September 2021\par 17:01\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2021 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     By Susan Mathew\par     Sept 14 (Reuters) - Emerging market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  hit a session\par high on Tuesday after tamer than expected U.S. inflation data\par dented the dollar, but soon gave up gains as it left questions\par about the \f28 \uc2 \f2 U.S. Federal Reserve\f28 \uc2 \f2 's next move. \par     MSCI's index of EM \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  gained as much\par as 0.2% after data showed underlying U.S. consumer prices rose \par at their slowest pace in six months.\par     The dollar index, which measures the greenback\par against six major rivals, fell up to 0.4% as the data created\par uncertainty about the Fed's stance on stimulus tapering. \par     But the EM index soon gave up gains to trade flat. \par     "While the inflation numbers might be the start of some\par "relief" and positive for high beta/risk \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , we think\par the market will need to get through the Fed meeting first before\par it can break "free"," strategists at \f28 \uc2 \f2 TD Securities\f28 \uc2 \f2  said. \par     In Latam, Brazil's real fell back into the red\par shortly after the inflation data. \par     While prospects of further interest rate hikes lend some\par support, political tensions ahead of elections next year are\par weighing on the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and companies have cited this as a new\par risk factor for initial public offerings in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Brazil\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par     \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Brazil\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is likely to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par market due to seasonal demand for dollars concentrated near the\par end of the year, its chief \f28 \uc2 \f2 Roberto Campos Neto\f28 \uc2 \f2  said.\par     Meanwhile, Japan's \f28 \uc2 \f2 SoftBank Group\f28 \uc2 \f2  renewed its LatAm\par bet, launching a $3 billion fund to invest in technology\par companies in the region.\par     Mexico's peso retreated further from four-week highs,\par down 0.2%. The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , which has largely been on an upward\par trend, has gained 2.5% over the last 12 sessions. \par     Ratings agency Fitch on Monday warned that Mexico's\par weakening governance is raising credit uncertainties, citing\par energy, utilities, infrastructure and financial institutions as\par the most affected.\par     In Chile, indigenous communities living around the Atacama\par salt flat have asked authorities to suspend lithium miner SQM's\par  operating permits or sharply reduce its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par until it submits an environmental compliance plan acceptable to\par regulators.\par     Shares in the world's No. 2 producer of lithium, which is\par used in batteries for electric vehicles, were flat. \par     Brazil's \f28 \uc2 \f2 BTG Pactual\f28 \uc2 \f2  jumped almost 3% on a report\par that Singapore's state investor \f28 \uc2 \f2 GIC Pte Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2  is investing $421\par million into the lender's private equity fund which controls\par Brazilian fiber optic company V.tal. \par     \par     Key Latin American stock indexes and \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  at 1429 GMT:\par    Stock indexes           Latest    Daily %\par                                      change\par  MSCI Emerging Markets      1296.89    -0.36\par                                      \par  MSCI LatAm                 2414.83    -0.43\par                                      \par  Brazil Bovespa           116501.66     0.08\par                                      \par  Mexico IPC                51443.23     -0.1\par                                      \par  Chile IPSA                 4424.78     0.53\par                                      \par  Argentina MerVal          79985.45     -0.1\par                                      \par  Colombia COLCAP            1309.34    -0.24\par                                      \par                                             \par       \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2            Latest    Daily %\par                                      change\par  Brazil real                 5.2350    -0.24\par                                      \par  Mexico peso                19.8980    -0.17\par                                      \par  Chile peso                   785.1    -0.10\par                                      \par  Colombia peso              3823.62     0.12\par                                      \par  Peru sol                       4.1    -0.10\par                                      \par  Argentina peso             98.2200    -0.03\par  (interbank)                         \par                                      \par  \par     \par  (Reporting by Susan Mathew in Bengaluru; Editing by Alexander\par Smith)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Released: 2021-9-14T16:01:11.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020210914eh9e02r8b\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
