\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 4- \highlight22\uc2 Brazil central bank \highlight \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2 , bond  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  fails to prevent market rout\b0\par\par\uc2 474 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2020\par 21:33\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2020 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 (Updates closing prices, adds comment)\par \par \uc2 By Jamie McGeever\par \par \uc2 BRASILIA, March 18 (Reuters) - Brazilian markets sank on Wednesday, with the real hitting a new low and stocks and bonds falling sharply, even as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  waded into the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and bond markets to try and restore calm on another day of wild price swings and intense volatility.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold $830 million in two rounds of spot \b \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and announced a repurchase program for dollar-denominated sovereign bonds held by Brazilian banks, which will be carried out in conjunction with the Treasury.\par \par \uc2 But investors feared the trillions of dollars of stimulus and support from authorities around the world to limit the economic damage from the coronavirus pandemic may not be enough.\par \par \uc2 The real slumped almost 5% to as low as 5.2490 per dollar , bringing its losses so far this year close to 25%.\par \par \uc2 The benchmark Bovespa index closed down 11.45%, after trading was halted for the sixth time in a little over a week when losses reached 10% early in the session. The index is down 35% so far this month, and down more than 40% this year.\par \par \uc2 Economists at \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  now predict a deep recession in Brazil this year, seeing economic contraction of 0.9%. Two weeks ago they were forecasting growth of 1.5%.\par \par \uc2 "The depreciation pressure on the real is likely to be managed/mitigated mostly through \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 : dollar liquidity repo lines, auctions of dollar swaps, and outright spot dollar sales from reserves," Goldman said in a note.\par \par \uc2 Traders were also bracing for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's latest interest rate decision scheduled for 6 p.m. local time Wednesday. The consensus was for a quarter-point cut to a new low of 4.00%, but the rapid economic and financial deterioration could see policymakers act more aggressively.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said in a statement that the bond repurchase program comes into force on Wednesday, and the Treasury said the auctions will be held on March 19, 20, 23, 24 and 25.\par \par \uc2 "The objective of this action is to continue providing support to the public debt market, ensuring the smooth functioning of this and other related markets," it said.\par \par \uc2 A \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spokesman said the total stock of bonds available for the repurchase \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  currently held by Brazilian banks stands at $31 billion, and that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could buy the whole lot, depending on banks' demand for cash.\par \par \uc2 The last time the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  conducted this type of bond market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was in 2008, he added.\par \par \uc2 Brazilian interest rate futures rose sharply on Wednesday, with implied rates on contracts out to 2027 and beyond nudging 9%. (Reporting by Jamie McGeever Editing by Tom Brown and Leslie Adler) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2020-3-18T21:33:15.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020200318eg3i03fud\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw103\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1545\pichgoal600
